  "releaseNotes": "**DI016 null-coalescing throw guards** — builder `.Services` registration flows now remain recognizable through an identity-preserving `?? throw` guard, so `(builder.Services ?? throw ...).BuildServiceProvider()` reports like the unguarded call. Coalesces with an arbitrary fallback collection remain conservative and silent because the provider may be built from a different source.",
